WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.810
A friend calls your name from just
around the corner of a building.

2
00:00:03.860 --> 00:00:05.850
You hear every word.

3
00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:08.950
The sound has spread around
the edge and reached you.

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:10.990
Light is a wave too.

5
00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:14.320
Yet the light from your friend
leaves a sharp-edged shadow,

6
00:00:14.370 --> 00:00:15.870
and you see nothing.

7
00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:18.920
Both are waves, both meet the same corner.

8
00:00:18.970 --> 00:00:22.240
So what decides how much a wave spreads?

9
00:00:22.290 --> 00:00:26.650
In this mission, you'll watch waves spread
out as they pass through a gap or around

10
00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:28.330
the edge of an obstacle.

11
00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:31.640
Then you'll find out what stays
the same as a wave spreads,

12
00:00:31.690 --> 00:00:33.230
and what changes.

13
00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:37.410
Your mission: find out what
decides how much a wave spreads.
